{"ref":"BDB, אַלְמֹנִי","hw":"אַלְמֹנִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַלְמֹנִי</span></big>  <strong>adj. some one, a certain</strong> (name <em>unspoken</em>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מְקוֹם פְּלֹנִי א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.3\">1 S 21:3</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.8\">2 K 6:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ א׳</span> alone, of person, = <em>such-an-one, so-and-so</em> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:1\" href=\"/Ruth.4.1\">Ru 4:1</a>.","next":"BDB, אֶלָּסָר","prev":"BDB, אַלְמָנוּת"}